# ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
# ║ AŁEK’RYŦHÆ CORE  •  SOURCE CONTROL BOUNDARY                               ║
# ║ Track reproducible source and canonical artwork. Never commit local state.  ║
# ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
# SECURITY: .gitignore only filters UNTRACKED files. It does not purge Git history,
# prevent `git add -f`, scan secrets, or protect files already tracked.

