# 11  Explicitly TRACK the actual source contracts and canonical visual assets.
# The ignore rules above intentionally never target *.cs, *.js, *.json, *.md,
# *.ps1, *.cmd, *.sln, *.csproj, *.alek, *.ico, *.png or other authored artwork.
# Example fixtures needing SQLite files must be consciously reviewed and added
# with `git add -f`, preferably as synthetic/redacted data instead.
